@ClinicManagementApp.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7083
@AuthToken = 

### ==============================================================================
### 1. SYSTEM INITIALIZATION & OWNER GENESIS (Zero-Trust Setup)
### ==============================================================================

### Check if initial Owner setup is required
GET {{ClinicManagementApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/setup-status
Accept: application/json

### One-Time Owner Account Genesis (Locks itself after creating first account)
POST {{ClinicManagementApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/initial-setup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "owner@clinic.com",
  "password": "YOUR_LOCAL_TEST_PASSWORD_HERE",
  "fullName": "Dr. Owner Dentist",
  "phone": "09171234567"
}

### Authenticate / Login (Returns JWT Access Token + Refresh Token)
# @name login
POST {{ClinicManagementApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "owner@example.com",
  "password": "YOUR_LOCAL_TEST_PASSWORD_HERE"
}

### Refresh Expired Access Token
POST {{ClinicManagementApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/refresh-token
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.data.refreshToken}}"
}


### ==============================================================================
### 2. OWNER-CONTROLLED STAFF MANAGEMENT (/api/v1/users)
### ==============================================================================

### Get Current User Profile
GET {{ClinicManagementApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
Accept: application/json

### List All Staff Accounts (Owner only)
GET {{ClinicManagementApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/users
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
Accept: application/json

### Provision a New Staff Account (Owner only)
# @name createStaff
POST {{ClinicManagementApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/users
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "staff.maria@clinic.com",
  "password": "StaffPassword123!",
  "fullName": "Maria Santos",
  "role": "Owner",
  "phone": "09181234567"
}

### KILL SWITCH: Deactivate Account and Immediately Terminate All Sessions
PUT {{ClinicManagementApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/users/{{createStaff.response.body.data.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}

### Reactivate Account
PUT {{ClinicManagementApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/users/{{createStaff.response.body.data.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": true
}

### Owner Administrative Password Override (Force-change without old password)
PUT {{ClinicManagementApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/users/{{createStaff.response.body.data.id}}/admin-reset-password
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newPassword": "YOUR_LOCAL_TEST_PASSWORD_HERE"
}

### Kick Out All Devices / Revoke All Sessions
POST {{ClinicManagementApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/users/{{createStaff.response.body.data.id}}/revoke-sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}


### ==============================================================================
### 3. PATIENT MANAGEMENT (/api/v1/patients)
### ==============================================================================

### Register a New Patient
# @name createPatient
POST {{ClinicManagementApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/patients
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Juan",
  "lastName": "Dela Cruz",
  "age": 28,
  "gender": "Male",
  "phone": "09179876543",
  "role": "Oral Prophylaxis (Cleaning)",
  "consultationFee": 800.00,
  "consultationNotes": "Patient has mild gingivitis on lower incisors.",
  "status": "Active"
}

### Get Paginated List of Patients with Search & Filter
GET {{ClinicManagementApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/patients?search=Juan&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
Accept: application/json

### Get Patient Details with Clinical Counts
GET {{ClinicManagementApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/patients/{{createPatient.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
Accept: application/json

### Update Patient Record
PUT {{ClinicManagementApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/patients/{{createPatient.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Juan",
  "lastName": "Dela Cruz",
  "age": 29,
  "gender": "Male",
  "phone": "09179876543",
  "role": "Oral Prophylaxis (Cleaning)",
  "consultationFee": 850.00,
  "consultationNotes": "Routine cleaning completed. Advised brushing 3x daily.",
  "status": "Active"
}

### Soft-Delete / Archive Patient
DELETE {{ClinicManagementApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/patients/{{createPatient.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}


### ==============================================================================
### 4. APPOINTMENT SCHEDULING & REMINDERS (/api/v1/appointments)
### ==============================================================================

### Schedule an Appointment (Auto-links patient)
# @name createAppointment
POST {{ClinicManagementApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": null,
  "patientName": "Anna Reyes",
  "patientPhone": "09195551234",
  "procedure": "Dental Fillings (Restoration)",
  "appointmentDateTime": "2026-09-20T10:00:00Z",
  "durationMinutes": 45,
  "notes": "Upper left premolar filling replacement",
  "reminderMinutesBefore": 60
}

### Get Upcoming Appointments (For Dashboard)
GET {{ClinicManagementApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/appointments/upcoming?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
Accept: application/json

### Filter Appointments by Date Range
GET {{ClinicManagementApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/appointments?startDate=2026-09-01&endDate=2026-09-30
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
Accept: application/json

### Reschedule Appointment
PUT {{ClinicManagementApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/appointments/{{createAppointment.response.body.data.id}}/reschedule
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newDateTime": "2026-09-21T14:30:00Z",
  "durationMinutes": 45
}

### Send SMS / WhatsApp Reminder
POST {{ClinicManagementApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/appointments/send-sms-reminder
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "appointmentId": {{createAppointment.response.body.data.id}}
}

### Complete Appointment (Automatically posts treatment to patient ledger)
POST {{ClinicManagementApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/appointments/{{createAppointment.response.body.data.id}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}


### ==============================================================================
### 5. TREATMENTS & CLINICAL PROCEDURES (/api/v1/treatments, /api/v1/catalog)
### ==============================================================================

### Get Procedure Pricing Catalog
GET {{ClinicManagementApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/catalog/procedures
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
Accept: application/json

### Add New Custom Procedure to Catalog (Owner only)
POST {{ClinicManagementApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/catalog/procedures
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Porcelain Veneer",
  "category": "Cosmetic",
  "baselinePrice": 12000.00,
  "description": "Custom laboratory-fabricated laminate veneer"
}

### Record a Treatment Visit
# @name createTreatment
POST {{ClinicManagementApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/treatments
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": 1,
  "treatmentType": "Tooth Extraction",
  "consultationFee": 1200.00,
  "dateCreated": "2026-09-18T10:00:00Z",
  "isInstallment": false
}

### Get Patient Treatments Ledger
GET {{ClinicManagementApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/treatments/patient/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
Accept: application/json


### ==============================================================================
### 6. ORTHODONTIC CONTRACTS & INSTALLMENT PLANS (/api/v1/orthodontics)
### ==============================================================================

### Create New Braces Contract for Patient
# @name createContract
POST {{ClinicManagementApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/orthodontics/contract
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": 1,
  "totalContractPrice": 50000.00,
  "downPayment": 10000.00,
  "termsMonths": 24,
  "startDate": "2026-09-18T10:00:00Z"
}

### Record Monthly Adjustment / Installment Payment
POST {{ClinicManagementApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/orthodontics/payment
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": 1,
  "amount": 1500.00,
  "paymentDate": "2026-09-18T11:00:00Z",
  "notes": "Month 1 Wire Change & Bracket Rebond"
}

### Get Live Orthodontic Summary (Remaining Balance, Amortization, Progress)
GET {{ClinicManagementApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/orthodontics/patient/1/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
Accept: application/json


### ==============================================================================
### 7. EXPENSE TRACKING (/api/v1/expenses)
### ==============================================================================

### Log a Clinic Expense
# @name createExpense
POST {{ClinicManagementApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Dental Supply Restock (Composite & Gloves)",
  "amount": 4500.00,
  "category": "Supplies",
  "date": "2026-09-18T09:00:00Z",
  "isRecurringFixedCost": false
}

### Log a Recurring Fixed Clinic Overhead (e.g. Clinic Rent)
POST {{ClinicManagementApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clinic Space Lease",
  "amount": 20000.00,
  "category": "Rent",
  "date": "2026-09-01T00:00:00Z",
  "isRecurringFixedCost": true
}

### Get Filtered Expenses
GET {{ClinicManagementApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/expenses?category=Supplies
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
Accept: application/json

### Get Expense Category Breakdown
GET {{ClinicManagementApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/expenses/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
Accept: application/json


### ==============================================================================
### 8. FINANCIAL ANALYTICS & BIR TAX ENGINE (/api/v1/reports, /api/v1/taxes)
### ==============================================================================

### Aggregated Dashboard Figures (Gross, expenses, patient count, 6-month trends)
GET {{ClinicManagementApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/reports/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
Accept: application/json

### Period Financial Breakdown (ThisMonth, ThisQuarter, ThisYear, AllTime)
GET {{ClinicManagementApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/reports/period?period=ThisMonth
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
Accept: application/json

### Philippine BIR Quarterly Tax Computation (8% Flat Rate under TRAIN Law)
GET {{ClinicManagementApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/taxes/quarterly?year=2026&quarter=3&regime=EightPercentFlat&deductionMethod=Itemized&form2307Credits=0
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
Accept: application/json

### Philippine BIR Quarterly Tax Computation (Graduated Rates + 3% Percentage Tax)
GET {{ClinicManagementApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/taxes/quarterly?year=2026&quarter=3&regime=GraduatedRates&deductionMethod=OSD&form2307Credits=0
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
Accept: application/json

### Upcoming BIR Tax Deadlines & Severity Alerts
GET {{ClinicManagementApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/taxes/deadlines
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
Accept: application/json

### Senior Citizen / PWD 20% Statutory Discount Calculator
GET {{ClinicManagementApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/taxes/senior-pwd-discount?grossFee=1500&isVatRegistered=false
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
Accept: application/json


### ==============================================================================
### 9. OFFLINE-FIRST MOBILE SYNC & IDEMPOTENT OUTBOX ENGINE (/api/v1/sync)
### ==============================================================================

### Push a Single Mobile Mutation (Idempotent via Guid Id)
POST {{ClinicManagementApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/sync/push
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "e8a9df67-27b3-4f9a-8c9e-5b12a8ef4321",
  "entityType": "Patient",
  "entityId": "0",
  "operation": 1,
  "payloadJson": "{\"firstName\":\"Pedro\",\"lastName\":\"Penduko\",\"age\":35,\"gender\":\"Male\",\"phone\":\"09187654321\",\"role\":\"Oral Prophylaxis\",\"consultationFee\":600,\"status\":\"Active\"}",
  "createdAtUtc": "2026-09-18T10:00:00Z"
}

### Re-Push Same Record (Demonstrating Idempotency: Will Not Duplicate)
POST {{ClinicManagementApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/sync/push
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "e8a9df67-27b3-4f9a-8c9e-5b12a8ef4321",
  "entityType": "Patient",
  "entityId": "0",
  "operation": 1,
  "payloadJson": "{\"firstName\":\"Pedro\",\"lastName\":\"Penduko\",\"age\":35,\"gender\":\"Male\",\"phone\":\"09187654321\",\"role\":\"Oral Prophylaxis\",\"consultationFee\":600,\"status\":\"Active\"}",
  "createdAtUtc": "2026-09-18T10:00:00Z"
}

### Pull Server Changes Since Timestamp
GET {{ClinicManagementApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/sync/pull?since=2026-09-18T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
Accept: application/json

